    {
      "id": "20924eb1-ed54-8058-9b32-c2952cacc7cb",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "richText": [
        [
          "💬 What is "
        ],
        [
          "@ControllerAdvice",
          [
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          " and how is it used?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20924eb1-ed54-8014-8000-ee20be419cfa",
      "type": "text",
      "richText": [
        [
          "@ControllerAdvice",
          [
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          " is a Spring annotation that allows you to write global exception handlers. It catches exceptions thrown from any controller and lets you return custom responses like specific status codes or JSON error messages. It helps reduce code duplication and keeps controllers clean."
        ]
      ]
    },
